From 7eb7d9af6432158be92aadd79468a64e2413df42 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanne de Vries <65487235+sanne-san@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Feb 2026 14:59:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Move invoices into subscription settings (#6092)

* Move invoices into subscription settings

- Remove the dedicated /billing/invoices route, controller action,
  and template
- Remove the Invoices sidebar link (was conditionally shown when a
  subscription existed)
- Add invoices tile directly to the subscription settings page,
  hidden when there is no subscription
- Inline invoice fetching into the subscription controller action
- Fix table component padding for tables without a thead
- Add gap spacing to funnel and props settings lists (needed after removing the table padding)

* Add changelog entry

* Remove changelog entries as they're not relevant to self hosters
